# Subagent flow

<Toc />

<SubagentFlow id="flow" name="research, build, review">
<Stage n="1" title="Research" id="research" parallel="{{ parallel }}" output="Short findings with file paths, and no changes to any file" done="you could explain the change to someone else, with evidence for each claim">
Split the unknowns into separate questions, and give each to its own subagent.
</Stage>

<Stage n="2" title="Build" id="build" output="The changes made, and how they were checked" done="the code is changed and the relevant tests pass">
Give one subagent the plan and the findings. Build in parallel only if the parts touch different files.
</Stage>

<Stage n="3" title="Review" id="review" agent="a fresh subagent that did not write the code" output="Real problems found, each with a file, a line and why it matters" done="each problem is fixed, or you have explained why it stays">
Ask it to look for bugs in the changes. It has not seen your reasoning, which is the point.
</Stage>
</SubagentFlow>
